# Micro-LoRA-Tuner

A streamlined, production-ready implementation of Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning (PEFT) using QLoRA. 

Designed to fine-tune foundation models (like 0.5B parameter instruction models) on consumer hardware by utilizing 4-bit NormalFloat quantization, Gradient Checkpointing, and Paged Optimizers, all consolidated into a clean, flat architecture.

## Project Structure

```text
Micro-LoRA-Tuner/
├── train_sft.py      # Contains all config, data prep, and training logic
├── export.py         # Script to merge adapter weights for local inference
├── requirements.txt
├── .gitignore
└── README.md

pip install -r requirements.txt
python train_sft.py
python export.py
